flowchart TB
  MAC[Unknown MAC on Gi1/0/14] --> DIS[DEVICE_DISCOVERED]
  DIS --> IDN[Identity confidence ~5%: no AD object, unknown MAC, no DNS]
  IDN --> R1[Risk ~70]
  ACT[TCP/22 attempts blocked by default deny] --> R2[Risk > 80]
  R1 --> R2
  R2 --> POL{SECURITY-004: identity UNKNOWN, risk ≥ 80, not protected}
  POL -->|unmanaged endpoint, autonomy ≥ 3| TX[Quarantine transaction]
  POL -->|managed asset| APR[Approval, or autonomy 5]
  TX --> V1[Switchport → VLAN 99] --> V2[Leases revoked] --> V3[Policy test: TCP/22 to LINUX01 = DENY] --> MIT[Incident MITIGATED]
